@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
start
:One canonical .ghost.md document;
:Parse as CommonMark;
:Select top-level fenced code blocks\nwhose info string is exactly ghost\n(backtick or tilde fences);
note right
  Not executable: prose, tables, front matter,
  indented code, other info strings,
  ghost fences nested in lists/quotes or
  written inside a longer display fence,
  ghost-python, ghost with attributes
end note
:Keep document order;\nend each body with a newline;\nput one blank line between blocks;
:Parse the result as one program\nwith exactly one root control;
:Report diagnostics at original\nfile, line and column;
stop
@enduml
